This code creates a simple HTTP client that makes POST and PUT requests to the specified URL. It prints the status code, body, and any other relevant information for each request.

Please note that you need to add `org.apache.http.client` and `org.apache.http.impl.client` dependencies in your build.gradle file to use this code:

```groovy
dependencies {
    implementation 'org.apache.httpcomponents:httpclient:4.5.13'
}
```

